flowchart TD
    ENTRY([ENTRY])

    ENTRY --> NormalizeInput
    NormalizeInput --> IntentDetection
    IntentDetection --> IntentConfidenceGate

    IntentConfidenceGate -->|Low confidence| ClarificationFlow
    ClarificationFlow --> ResponseFormatter

    IntentConfidenceGate -->|High confidence| EntityExtraction
    EntityExtraction --> DomainValidation
    DomainValidation --> IntentRouter

    %% Intent router branches
    IntentRouter -->|procurement| ProcurementFlow
    IntentRouter -->|dns| DNSFlow
    IntentRouter -->|nameserver| NameserverFlow
    IntentRouter -->|transfer| TransferFlow
    IntentRouter -->|ownership| OwnershipFlow
    IntentRouter -->|url_redirect| URLRedirectFlow
    IntentRouter -->|subdomain| SubdomainRejectFlow
    IntentRouter -->|general| GeneralInquiryFlow

    %% Procurement
    ProcurementFlow --> CheckDomainAvailabilityTool
    CheckDomainAvailabilityTool --> ValidateBusinessContextTool
    ValidateBusinessContextTool --> CreateICARETicketTool
    CreateICARETicketTool --> ProcurementResponseNode

    %% DNS
    DNSFlow --> ValidateDomainOwnershipTool
    ValidateDomainOwnershipTool --> LookupDNSProviderTool
    LookupDNSProviderTool --> FetchDNSChangeFormTool
    FetchDNSChangeFormTool --> DNSResponseNode

    %% Nameserver
    NameserverFlow --> ValidateDomainOwnershipTool_NS
    ValidateDomainOwnershipTool_NS --> NameserverResponseNode

    %% Transfer
    TransferFlow --> ValidateTransferEligibilityTool
    ValidateTransferEligibilityTool --> IdentifyRegistrarTool
    IdentifyRegistrarTool --> CreateTransferRequestTool
    CreateTransferRequestTool --> TransferResponseNode

    %% Ownership
    OwnershipFlow --> LookupDomainInDISTool
    LookupDomainInDISTool --> FetchOwnerContactsTool
    FetchOwnerContactsTool --> OwnershipResponseNode

    %% URL Redirect
    URLRedirectFlow --> ValidateDomainTool
    ValidateDomainTool --> IdentifyRedirectOwnerTool
    IdentifyRedirectOwnerTool --> RedirectResponseNode

    %% Subdomain reject
    SubdomainRejectFlow --> ExtractParentDomainTool
    ExtractParentDomainTool --> LookupNameServersTool
    LookupNameServersTool --> SubdomainRejectionResponseNode

    %% General
    GeneralInquiryFlow --> KnowledgeLookupTool
    KnowledgeLookupTool --> GeneralResponseNode

    %% End
    ProcurementResponseNode --> ResponseFormatter
    DNSResponseNode --> ResponseFormatter
    NameserverResponseNode --> ResponseFormatter
    TransferResponseNode --> ResponseFormatter
    OwnershipResponseNode --> ResponseFormatter
    RedirectResponseNode --> ResponseFormatter
    SubdomainRejectionResponseNode --> ResponseFormatter
    GeneralResponseNode --> ResponseFormatter

    ResponseFormatter --> END([END])